id=uicc_oem_guard
name=Guard the empty perso status answer from the A13 RIL
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=MinsOS
description=With a Korean SIM, com.android.phone crash-looped every ~10 s and RescueParty warm-rebooted the S20+: UiccProfile event 110 (EVENT_GET_PERSO_STATUS_COMPLETE) reads two bytes from the answer to the KOR USIM perso query, and the SM-G986N A13 RIL answers it with zero bytes. A short answer now takes the existing null-result exit (log, perso lock unchanged).
